  promptOffset: {x: 0, y: 0.55, z: 0}
  pageNumber: 3
  dateHeader: May 8th
  pageText: 'Long sleeves again, even though it''s warm.

    The bruise on my arm
    is turning yellow. Yellow means it''s almost gone. I''ve learned the colours.

    Nobody
    at school asks. That''s the worst part. Not that it happens. That nobody asks.'
  panel: {fileID: 1101804383}
  dialogueRunner: {fileID: 1180829029}
  requiresFlags: 
  beforeDialogue: {fileID: 0}
  closeUpBefore: {fileID: 0}
