  promptOffset: {x: 0, y: 0.55, z: 0}
  pageNumber: 1
  dateHeader: April 3rd
  pageText: 'Today I turned sixteen. It''s also the day Mom died. She died giving
    birth to me.

    Dad doesn''t celebrate. He sits in front of her photo until
    the bottle is empty.

    I''ve never been allowed to be happy on my birthday.
    I don''t think I know how.'
  panel: {fileID: 1101804383}
