  pageNumber: 6
  dateHeader: June 14th
  pageText: 'Reina wrote KILLER on my desk in marker. Mika poured water into my bag.
    Saki laughed until she cried.

    When I scrubbed the desk, they said, "Look,
    she''s cleaning up the evidence."

    The teacher saw the desk. She told me
    to take better care of my things.'
  panel: {fileID: 1101804383}
  dialogueRunner: {fileID: 1180829029}
